          "style": "normal",
          "markDefs": [],
          "children": [
            {
              "_type": "span",
              "_key": "k2",
              "text": "First Baptist Church Muncie meets at 309 East Adams Street in Muncie, Indiana. Its website ran on Wix, with 142 blog posts, staff and ministry pages, and links out to forms and giving.",
              "marks": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "block",
          "_key": "k5",
          "style": "normal",
          "markDefs": [],
          "children": [
            {
              "_type": "span",
              "_key": "k4",
              "text": "The jobs for the new site, in order: make a first visit easy, help people find the staff and ministries, keep the church's history and every old post, and send giving and forms to the church's own systems. Staff also needed to keep it current without calling me.",
              "marks": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "block",
          "_key": "k7",
          "style": "h2",
          "markDefs": [],
          "children": [
            {
              "_type": "span",
              "_key": "k6",
              "text": "The approach",
              "marks": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "block",
          "_key": "k9",
          "style": "normal",
          "markDefs": [],
          "children": [
            {
              "_type": "span",
              "_key": "k8",
              "text": "I started from the building. My first design was clean and plain, and I set it aside for exactly that reason: it could have belonged to any church. The second pass takes its shapes from this one. The tall lancet window and the low Adams Street door became the frames for photographs, four line glyphs drawn from the sanctuary mark the church's four goals, and the 1927 Hannaford rendering of the church sits at the foot of every page.",
              "marks": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "block",
          "_key": "kb",
          "style": "normal",
          "markDefs": [],
          "children": [
            {
              "_type": "span",
              "_key": "ka",
              "text": "The colors are the five in the church's logo, used as accents on warm paper, and every photograph is of this congregation and this building. The church's own headings and approved sentences stay in its own words.",
              "marks": []
            }
          ]
        },
